# charmonium: every PDG state with a Monte Carlo id. mcid channel n [fit|predict]
# fit set = the eight states below the D Dbar threshold (notes Table 2); the rest are predictions.
# (X(3872) = chi_c1(2P) has no Monte Carlo id in the PDG file and is not listed.)
441      1S0  0 fit      # eta_c(1S)
443      3S1  0 fit      # J/psi(1S)
10441    3P0  0 fit      # chi_c0(1P)
20443    3P1  0 fit      # chi_c1(1P)
10443    1P1  0 fit      # h_c(1P)
445      3P2  0 fit      # chi_c2(1P)
100441   1S0  1 fit      # eta_c(2S)
100443   3S1  1 fit      # psi(2S)
30443    3D1  0 predict  # psi(3770)
100445   3P2  1 predict  # chi_c2(3930) = chi_c2(2P)
9000443  3S1  2 predict  # psi(4040) = 3S
9010443  3D1  1 predict  # psi(4160) = 2D
9020443  3S1  3 predict  # psi(4415) = 4S
